Use of our applications (""Apps"") are governed by the terms you accepted at the time you purchased or downloaded it, these Terms and the terms of your mobile service provider and mobile device operator. Our social media pages, which include but are not limited to Facebook, Twitter and LinkedIn (collectively ""Social Media""), are delivered to you in accordance with these Terms and the terms of use of each of the Social Media operators.

By accessing and using this Website, the Apps and/or the Social Media you certify that you are of legal age to form a legally binding contract, and you further agree to such terms and conditions, as they may be modified by IDB Invest from time-to-time and posted on this Web Site.

