Users may not place ""frames"" around or mirror material from the Web Site without the express written authorization of IDB Invest. Users may not reproduce, modify, copy, sell, create derivative works from, distribute, or publicly display any content from, or exploit for any commercial purposes, any material, information, content, code or data on or available through  the Web Site, its Apps and/or Social Media.

The contents of materials expressly attributed to third parties are the property and responsibility of such third parties and not of IDB Invest. Use of such information is subject to the legal terms and conditions set forth by the relevant third parties. Trade names, marks, logos and domains contained on the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media are the intellectual property of their respective owners and are protected by intellectual property laws.

**License**: IDB Invest grants you a limited, non-transferable, revocable license to access the Website and view the content on the Apps and Social Media on your personal computer or mobile device for your personal use only. Access to the Web Site, Apps and Social Media is licensed, not sold, to you, for use only under these Terms, the terms of your mobile service provider and mobile device operator, and the terms of use of each of the Social Media operators, as applicable. IDB Invest may revoke your license to access and/or use the Website, Apps and Social Media, at any time and for any reason without advance notice to you.

