**Use of Communications Facilities**: This Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media may contain bulletin boards, chat rooms, access to mailing lists or other message or communication facilities. You agree to use the communication facilities only to send and receive information and materials that is proper and relevant to the communication facility.

When using the communication facilities you will not: defame, abuse, harass, threaten or otherwise violate the legal rights of others; publish, post or distribute any defamatory, infringing, obscene, indecent or unlawful material; upload or attach files that contain copyrighted material unless you own or control such copyright; upload or attach files that contain viruses or similar software; delete any author attributions or legal/proprietary notices in any file that is uploaded; advertise or offer goods or services, or conduct surveys, contests or chain letters; or download any file posted that you know, or reasonably should know, cannot be legally distributed in such manner.

Any contribution you post to the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media will be considered non-confidential and non-proprietary. By providing any contribution on the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media, you grant IDB Invest, the Inter-American Development Bank Group members and IDB Invest’s service providers, and each of their, and our respective licensees, successors and assigns the right to use, reproduce, modify, perform, display, distribute and otherwise disclose to third parties any such material.

**Personal Information and Cookies**: IDB Invest does not automatically collect personal information regarding your use of the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media. However, if you submit any information through an interface of the Web Site, an App and/or Social Media including while registering for an event or inquiring about financing for your enterprise, or if you use a communications facility of the Web Site, App and/or Social Media you may be asked for personal information such as your name, place of employment and email address, or information related to your business such as number of employees, annual sales information, etc. Any reliance you place on such information is strictly at your own risk.

We disclaim all liability and responsibility arising from any reliance placed on such materials by you or any other visitor to the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media, or by anyone who may be informed of any of its contents.  
Information provided by you through the Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media may be used by the Inter-American Investment Corporation (IDB Invest) and shared with the Inter-American Development Bank and other strategic partners of IDB Invest to determine eligibility for financial and nonfinancial products. Furthermore, by using this Web Site, you accept that the information you provide to IDB Invest through the Web Site will be treated in accordance with[IDB Invest's Disclosure of Information Policy](https://idbinvest.org/en/access-information-policy).

The Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media may set a cookie that enables the Web Site to remember you the next time you visit, so that you don’t have to re-enter information that you already typed in. Likewise, IDB Invest, through this Web Site, Apps and/or Social Media may collect and use technical data and related information, including but not limited to technical information about your mobile device, system and application software in order to provide support and services to you.  
